{"name": "Psionic Sentry : Infinite", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psionic Sentry : Infinite is a anime girl action shooting  game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">use bows and various random skills to defeat enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Counterattack\" is a crucial combat tactic where bows transform into scythes to deflect enemy ranged attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Counterattack\" in this game isn't a highly difficult skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">counterattack judgment quite leniently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">aiming for every player to enjoy the thrill of counterattacking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core mechanics of combat: Counterattack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/4086fc1fbc539a60995d45d8b0ac4b70.poster.avif?t=1744900259\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/4086fc1fbc539a60995d45d8b0ac4b70.webm?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/4086fc1fbc539a60995d45d8b0ac4b70.mp4?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/6ef05fadfc7a3e05be67bfd757ff4864.poster.avif?t=1744900259\" width=\"666\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/6ef05fadfc7a3e05be67bfd757ff4864.webm?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/6ef05fadfc7a3e05be67bfd757ff4864.mp4?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>All \"ranged attacks\" in the game can be counterattacked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a series of \"long-range attacks\" are all counterattacked successfully, you will enter a \"combat close-up\" and cause a lot of damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting back may seem difficult</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But I designed its judgment to be looser in order to allow any player to enjoy the fun of counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core mechanism of combat: Shield breaking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/4430c0a58d7ea1b34f69115e6bc13776.poster.avif?t=1744900259\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/4430c0a58d7ea1b34f69115e6bc13776.webm?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/4430c0a58d7ea1b34f69115e6bc13776.mp4?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>When a shield appears on the enemy, use the corresponding skill to break the shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroying them all will temporarily weaken the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core mechanism of combat: skill selection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"408\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/3c7963ea0623ad7f3503ada85239d0c9.poster.avif?t=1744900259\" width=\"726\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/3c7963ea0623ad7f3503ada85239d0c9.webm?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/extras/3c7963ea0623ad7f3503ada85239d0c9.mp4?t=1744900259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Players will be able to experience a variety of random skills in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your favorite skills to create a unique gaming experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X\uff1a</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Psionic Sentry : Infinite is a third-person beautiful girl action shooting rougelike. The refreshing counterattack system that any player can use is the core of the game's operation. Observing the enemy's weaknesses and destroying them during battle is the focus of the game strategy.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598800/header.jpg?t=1744900259", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Female Protagonist", "Anime", "Indie", "Third-Person Shooter", "Archery", "Third Person"], "developers": "Roy, \u97ff\u96e8\u4e92\u52d5\u5a1b\u6a02, HowlingRain", "publishers": "Roy, \u97ff\u96e8\u4e92\u52d5\u5a1b\u6a02, HowlingRain", "release_date": "Feb 2, 2025", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "2598800", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "2 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/FcXAUIgJkFc", "first_seen": 1738450800.0, "review_rank": 1871}